        Release(version: "2.19.1 (96)", date: "27 November 2026", headline: "Gym sessions: the weights stand out in bold orange", items: [
            "Body · Changed: the weights on the Gym sessions card stand out. Before (2.19): under the time and the counts there is one line per machine, like Leg press · best 90 kg × 10 · new best. The machine name was dark, but everything after it (best 90 kg × 10 and new best) was small grey text, so the weights were easy to miss. Now: the machine name stays dark; the word best stays grey; the figure itself (90 kg × 10, or for a cardio machine like Bike, 15 min · level 6) is bold and in the card's own orange; and new best is also bold orange. pain noted stays grey. Example now: Leg press · best 90 kg × 10 · new best, with 90 kg × 10 and new best in bold orange.",
